<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <IsTrimmable>true</IsTrimmable>
    <EnableAoTAnalyzer>true</EnableAoTAnalyzer>
    <AssemblyName>diff-to-json</AssemblyName>
    <ToolCommandName>diff-to-json</ToolCommandName>
    <RootNamespace>DiffToJsonCli</RootNamespace>
    <PackageId>DiffToJson</PackageId>
    <PackAsTool>true</PackAsTool>
    <Title>DiffToJson</Title>
    <Authors>Alastair Lundy</Authors>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/alastairlundy/DiffToJson</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <IsPackable>true</IsPackable>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <EnableSingleFileAnalyzer>true</EnableSingleFileAnalyzer>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <Description>A CLI for detecting and serializing Git commit Diffs and commit messages from a local Git repository to a JSONL file.

This can be useful for preparing git commit diffs and message data for training AI/ML models or similar use cases.</Description>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) Alastair Lundy 2026</Copyright>
    <PackageTags>git, diff, commit, JSONL, JSON</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes># Changes since 0.7.0

## Added
- File access in the library now goes through an injectable file system, so tests can run without touching the real file system.
- After the models.dev catalog loads, reading supported reasoning values no longer waits on a network request.

## Changed
- `RunInputs` is replaced by `RawValue`, `RunRawInput`, and `RunTrainingInput`.
- Reasoning effort mapping is now documented and tested. OpenAI-style providers map `auto` and `on` to `medium`, and send `none` for `off`. Anthropic Effort models omit the property for `auto` and `on`, and send `reasoning_effort: off` for `off`.
- Extraction uses less memory during JSONL writing, PII redaction, prompt substitution, and git log parsing.
- Updated dependencies, including `CliInvoke` 3.2.0-beta.1, `Anthropic` 13.13.0, `Microsoft.Extensions.AI` packages 11.0.1, `Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection` 11.0.0, `System.CommandLine` 3.0.0, and `TUnit` 1.87.12.

## Removed
- Removed the old hardcoded `ReasoningEffortMatrix`. Supported reasoning values now come from the models.dev catalog, with a small manual exception for MiniMax M-series models and `deepseek-chat`.

## Fixed
- Built-in prompt presets failed to load because placeholder names were parsed as empty. The placeholder pattern now captures names correctly.
- Provider ids are now lowercased in a culture-safe way, so they resolve correctly in cultures such as Turkish.

## Security
- The publish-nuget workflow now pins GitHub-owned actions by hash.
- `SECURITY.md` now documents dependency advisories.
</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <Version>0.8.0</Version>
    <PackageVersion>0.8.0</PackageVersion>
    <AssemblyVersion>0.8.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>0.8.0.0</FileVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <!-- Default: don't use Native AOT for publishing as Tool -->
    <EnablePublishAot Condition="'$(PublishAot)'==''">false</EnablePublishAot>
  </PropertyGroup>
  
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Anthropic" />
    <PackageReference Include="CliInvoke" />
    <PackageReference Include="Meziantou.Analyzer">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.AI.OpenAI" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection" />
    <PackageReference Include="OllamaSharp" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.CommandLine" />
    <PackageReference Include="TestableIO.System.IO.Abstractions.Wrappers" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(PublishAot)'=='true'">
    <PublishAot>true</PublishAot>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="PiiTest\**" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="PiiTest\**" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Remove="PiiTest\**" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="..\..\README.md">
      <Link>README.md</Link>
      <PackagePath>README.md</PackagePath>
    </Content>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\DiffToJsonLib\DiffToJsonLib.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
